# DangDone

https://dl.acm.org/doi/pdf/10.1145/3275219.3275231

though im skeptical about its performance since now it has to go through two pointer indirections. this seems like how std::shared_ptr works.

discord user Iran "Maikel van den Hout" wants to adjust that by taking out strong references, and having only one owning reference and multiple weak references, similar to vale. he also wants to use direct borrow references where possible.


